  "reasoning": "The defendants premeditated and used a fictitious investment scheme (the so‑called ‘Harvard financial project’) to attract victims, promising returns and dividends. They obtained money from more than 30 victims, amounting to over 400,000 RMB, by means of false statements and deception. This matches the legal definition of fraud (诈骗罪). No other offenses are indicated in the facts or the prosecution’s charge, so the appropriate charge is fraud.",
